    {"id": "V3-car_p001_c0000", "title": "来源: Compliance & Risks: SASO Textile TR Edition 2 Analysis source_id: SRC-008 视角", "content": "来源: Compliance & Risks: SASO Textile TR Edition 2 Analysis source_id: SRC-008 视角: global_regulatory_expert URL: https://www.complianceandrisks.com/blog/what-you-need-to-know-about-the-technical-regulations-for-textiles-in-saudi-arabia/ source_type: compliance_consultancy_blog author: Kimberly Plassche author_role: Senior Regulatory Consultant, Compliance & Risks published_date: 2024-03-04 action_recommendation: consult full Edition 2 text for verification; Edition 1-based info should be flagged stale project_relevance: compliance_dimension_critical_update key_insight: 这是项目里最重要的\'新旧版本辨析\'信源，建议在 R", "source": "Compliance & Risks-SASO.json", "dimension": "compliance", "tags": []},
